Fixes: e7a8ebc305f2 ("NFSD: Offer write delegation for OPEN with OPEN4_SHARE_ACCESS_WRITE")
Cc: stable@vger.kernel.org
Reviewed-by: Jeff Layton <jlayton@kernel.org>
